sentences.text:
Let the applicant Salim @ Shamim involved in Case Crime No.137 of 2022, under Section 363, 504,
376-D of I.P.C. and 5/6 POCSO Act, Section 3(2)(Va) of SC/ST Act, Police Station Bilari, District Moradabad be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions;
(i) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that he shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence when the witnesses are present in court.

